{"resource":{"id":"rust-cheat-sheet","title":"Rust — Cheat Sheet","category":"Programming","difficulty":"Beginner","readingTime":"5 min","pages":2,"lastUpdated":"June 2026","tags":["Programming","Rust","Systems"],"heroImage":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1461749280684-dccba630e2f6?w=1800&q=80","heroSubtitle":"Printable two-page Rust cheat sheet — syntax, ownership, borrowing, lifetimes, traits, Cargo, collections, error handling, async, macros."},"toc":[{"id":"objectives","label":"Learning Objectives"},{"id":"s1","label":"1. Syntax"},{"id":"s2","label":"2. Ownership Rules"},{"id":"s3","label":"3. Borrowing"},{"id":"s4","label":"4. Lifetimes"},{"id":"s5","label":"5. Traits & Generics"},{"id":"s6","label":"6. Cargo Commands"},{"id":"s7","label":"7. Collections"},{"id":"s8","label":"8. Error Handling"},{"id":"s9","label":"9. Async Basics"},{"id":"s10","label":"10. Macros"},{"id":"s11","label":"11. Interview Reminders"},{"id":"summary","label":"Summary"},{"id":"faqs","label":"FAQ"},{"id":"glossary","label":"Glossary"},{"id":"references","label":"References"},{"id":"disclaimer","label":"Disclaimer"}],"related":[{"title":"Rust — Quick Revision Notes","tag":"Programming","time":"9 min"},{"title":"Rust — PDF Notes","tag":"Programming","time":"69 min"},{"title":"Rust — Complete Tutorial","tag":"Programming","time":"41 min"}],"html":"<section id=\"objectives\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Learning Objectives</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Keep every important Rust construct on one desk-side sheet.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s1\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">1. Syntax</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>python</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>let x = 5;              let mut y = 10;\nconst PI: f64 = 3.14;   static NAME: &amp;str = &quot;N&quot;;\nif c {} else {}         while c {}   loop {}\nfor i in 0..10 {}       match x { 1 =&gt; .., _ =&gt; .. }\nfn add(a:i32,b:i32)-&gt;i32 { a+b }</code></pre></div>\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1451187580459-43490279c0fa?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Figure 1 — Rust syntax landscape on a single page.\" />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s2\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">2. Ownership Rules</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Each value has one owner.</li>\n          <li>Ownership moves on assignment (unless Copy).</li>\n          <li>Value dropped when owner leaves scope.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s3\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">3. Borrowing</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Many <code>&amp;T</code> XOR one <code>&amp;mut T</code>. No dangling.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s4\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">4. Lifetimes</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>python</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>fn f&lt;&#x27;a&gt;(x: &amp;&#x27;a str, y: &amp;&#x27;a str) -&gt; &amp;&#x27;a str { .. }</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s5\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">5. Traits &amp; Generics</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>python</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>trait Area { fn area(&amp;self) -&gt; f64; }\nfn show&lt;T: Area&gt;(t: &amp;T) { println!(&quot;{}&quot;, t.area()); }</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s6\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">6. Cargo Commands</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>python</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>cargo new / build / run / test / bench\ncargo add serde &amp;&amp; cargo update\ncargo clippy &amp;&amp; cargo fmt</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s7\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">7. Collections</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p><code>Vec&lt;T&gt;</code>, <code>String</code>, <code>HashMap&lt;K,V&gt;</code>, <code>HashSet&lt;T&gt;</code>, <code>BTreeMap</code>, <code>VecDeque</code>.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s8\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">8. Error Handling</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>python</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>fn read() -&gt; Result&lt;String, io::Error&gt; {\n    let s = fs::read_to_string(&quot;f&quot;)?;\n    Ok(s)\n}</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s9\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">9. Async Basics</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>python</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>#[tokio::main]\nasync fn main() { let r = fetch().await; }</code></pre></div>\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544197150-b99a580bb7a8?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Figure 2 — Async task lifecycle: pending → polled → ready.\" />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s10\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">10. Macros</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p><code>println!</code>, <code>vec!</code>, <code>format!</code>, <code>dbg!</code>, <code>assert!</code>, custom via <code>macro_rules!</code>.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s11\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">11. Interview Reminders</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Rc vs Arc: single- vs multi-thread reference counting.</li>\n          <li>Mutex vs RwLock: exclusive vs shared-read locks.</li>\n          <li><code>?</code> desugars to match + return.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"summary\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Summary &amp; Key Takeaways</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Two pages. Print, laminate, keep on your desk.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"faqs\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">FAQ</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Missing something?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">The Quick Revision Notes go one level deeper.</div></details>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"glossary\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Glossary</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li><strong>?</strong> — early-return on <code>Err</code>.</li>\n          <li><strong>Copy</strong> — trait for bitwise-duplicable types.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"references\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">References</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\"><References /></div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"disclaimer\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Disclaimer</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Reference only — pair with practice.</p>\n      </div></section>"}